oderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5ae17ad", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "13a1f20", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2116560", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "847e8b9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e636dee", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "d7ec445", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ddf3023", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "576f28e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a28effa", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Při realizaci webu pro firmu Břinčil jsme kladli důraz na moderní a přehledný design, snadnou orientaci návštěvníků a kvalitní prezentaci společnosti i její techniky. Nový web zároveň slouží jako podpůrná prezentace hlavní společnosti Břinčil &amp; Míka s.r.o., pro kterou jsme v minulosti rovněž realizovali kompletní online prezentaci.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5a37cd8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "brincil.cz", "link": {"url": "https://brincil.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "980dd40", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-refs-more ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "c69dd6f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Další weby, e-shopy a kampaně najdete v portfoliu Yesmark.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d64dd10", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Všechny reference", "link": {"url": "https://yesmark.eu/reference/?utm_source=wwwwww.cz&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wwwwww_reference&utm_content=homepage_all", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--dark ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "17962d8", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "cenik"}, "elements": [{"id": "b8a41c1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-price", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "c7e0cc7", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-price-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8db68d9",